# Pluggables - Cursor AI Project Rules

This file contains coding standards and guidelines for AI assistants working on this project.

---

## Project Overview

**.NET 10 Plugin System** with Blazor Server UI, supporting hot-reloadable plugins with rich metadata and lifecycle management.

**Tech Stack:** C# 10+, .NET 10, Blazor Server, Tailwind CSS v4, xUnit, Reqnroll (BDD), Playwright (E2E), bUnit (Component Tests)

---

## UI & Styling Guidelines

### Framework & Architecture

**Tailwind CSS v4** with **shadcn/ui-inspired** component system

- **Dark theme only** - color-scheme: dark
- **Custom CSS variables** in `src/Pluggable.Shell/wwwroot/css/variables.css`
- **Component classes** in `src/Pluggable.Shell/wwwroot/css/input.css`
- **Auto-compilation** via MSBuild (see `Pluggable.Shell.csproj`)

### Color Palette

Primary colors (CSS variables in `:root`):
```css
--background: #1a1a27       /* Main background */
--foreground: #f4f5ff       /* Main text */
--card: #1f1f2e             /* Card backgrounds */
--primary: #7e6fff          /* Primary brand color (purple) */
--secondary: #f66426        /* Secondary brand color (orange) */
--muted: #2a2a3a            /* Muted backgrounds */
--muted-foreground: #a0a3b8 /* Muted text */
--destructive: #ff5252      /* Error/destructive actions */
--border: #2f2a4f           /* Border color */
--sidebar: #141420          /* Sidebar background */
--sidebar-border: #241f3b   /* Sidebar borders */
```

Use semantic color classes, not raw values:
```razor
✅ CORRECT
<div class="bg-background text-foreground">
<button class="bg-primary text-primary-foreground">

❌ INCORRECT
<div class="bg-[#1a1a27] text-[#f4f5ff]">
<button class="bg-purple-600 text-white">
```

### Component Classes

All components use **pre-defined classes** from `input.css`. Never use inline Tailwind utilities for components that have a class.

#### Buttons
```razor
<!-- Base button classes -->
<button class="btn btn-default">Default</button>
<button class="btn btn-destructive">Delete</button>
<button class="btn btn-outline">Outline</button>
<button class="btn btn-secondary">Secondary</button>
<button class="btn btn-ghost">Ghost</button>
<button class="btn btn-link">Link</button>

<!-- Size modifiers -->
<button class="btn btn-default btn-sm">Small</button>
<button class="btn btn-default btn-lg">Large</button>
<button class="btn btn-default btn-icon">🔍</button>

<!-- ALWAYS combine btn with a variant, never use btn alone -->
❌ <button class="btn">Bad</button>
✅ <button class="btn btn-default">Good</button>
```

#### Cards
```razor
<div class="card">
    <div class="card-header">
        <h3 class="card-title">Title</h3>
        <p class="card-description">Description</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-content">
        Content goes here
    </div>
    <div class="card-footer">
        <button class="btn btn-default">Action</button>
    </div>
</div>
```

#### Inputs & Labels
```razor
<div>
    <label class="label">Email</label>
    <input type="email" class="input" placeholder="you@example.com" />
</div>

<select class="input">
    <option>Option 1</option>
</select>
```

#### Tables
```razor
<div class="table-wrapper">
    <table class="table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Header</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>Data</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>
```

#### Badges
```razor
<span class="badge badge-default">Default</span>
<span class="badge badge-secondary">Secondary</span>
<span class="badge badge-destructive">Error</span>
<span class="badge badge-success">Success</span>
<span class="badge badge-outline">Outline</span>
```

#### Separators
```razor
<div class="separator separator-horizontal"></div>
<div class="separator separator-vertical"></div>
```

#### Stats (Dashboard)
```razor
<div class="stat-card">
    <div class="stat-title">Total Plugins</div>
    <div class="stat-value">24</div>
    <div class="stat-description">
        <span class="stat-trend-up">+12%</span> from last month
    </div>
</div>
```

### Layout Patterns

#### Sidebar Navigation
```razor
<!-- Collapsible sidebar using CSS-only peer-checked pattern -->
<input type="checkbox" id="sidebar-toggle" class="peer sr-only" />

<aside class="sidebar fixed inset-y-0 left-0 z-50 flex h-full w-64 flex-col border-r border-sidebar-border bg-sidebar transition-[width] duration-200 ease-in-out peer-checked:w-14">
    <nav class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto sidebar-scroll px-2 py-4">
        <div class="space-y-1">
            <NavLink class="nav-link" href="/" Match="NavLinkMatch.All">
                <svg class="size-5 shrink-0">...</svg>
                <span class="sidebar-text">Home</span>
            </NavLink>
        </div>
    </nav>
</aside>

<!-- Main content area - MUST be sibling of checkbox -->
<div class="min-h-screen ml-64 transition-[margin] duration-200 ease-in-out peer-checked:ml-14">
    <main class="flex-1 p-6">
        @Body
    </main>
</div>
```

**CRITICAL sidebar rules:**
1. Checkbox MUST have `peer` class
2. Sidebar MUST have `peer-checked:w-14` for collapsed width
3. Main content MUST have `peer-checked:ml-14` for collapsed margin
4. Both sidebar and main content MUST be direct siblings of the checkbox
5. Use `sidebar-text` class for text that should hide when collapsed

#### Page Layout
```razor
@page "/example"

<div class="space-y-6">
    <!-- Page Header -->
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <div>
            <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Page Title</h1>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground">Page description</p>
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-default">Action</button>
    </div>

    <!-- Content Cards -->
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="card">...</div>
    </div>
</div>
```

### Spacing & Typography

**Consistent spacing scale:**
- `gap-2` (0.5rem / 8px) - Tight spacing
- `gap-4` (1rem / 16px) - Default spacing
- `gap-6` (1.5rem / 24px) - Comfortable spacing
- `space-y-6` - Vertical stacking with 1.5rem gap

**Typography scale:**
```razor
<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Page Title</h1>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Section Title</h2>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Card Title</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Muted description</p>
<span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Small text</span>
```

### Icons

Use inline SVG with Lucide icon style (24x24 viewBox, 2px stroke):
```razor
<svg class="size-5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
    <path d="M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8"/>
    <path d="M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-5.999a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 5.999A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/>
</svg>
```

**Icon sizing:**
- `size-4` (16px) - Small icons (breadcrumbs, badges)
- `size-5` (20px) - Default icons (nav, buttons)
- `size-6` (24px) - Large icons (headers)

### State & Interaction

**Hover states:** All interactive elements should have hover states
```razor
<button class="... hover:bg-primary/90">
<div class="... hover:bg-muted/50">
```

**Focus states:** Use focus-visible for keyboard navigation
```razor
<button class="... focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring">
```

**Active states:** NavLink uses `.active` class automatically
```css
.nav-link.active {
    background-color: var(--primary);
    color: var(--primary-foreground);
}
```

**Transitions:** Use transition classes for smooth state changes
```razor
<div class="transition-colors">
<aside class="transition-[width] duration-200">
```

### Responsive Design

**Mobile-first approach:**
```razor
<!-- Stack on mobile, grid on tablet+ -->
<div class="flex flex-col md:grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">

<!-- Hide on mobile, show on desktop -->
<span class="hidden md:inline">Desktop only</span>

<!-- Responsive padding -->
<div class="p-4 md:p-6">
```

**Breakpoints:**
- `sm:` - 640px
- `md:` - 768px
- `lg:` - 1024px
- `xl:` - 1280px

### Component Guidelines

1. **Always use component classes** instead of rebuilding with utilities
   - ✅ `class="btn btn-default"`
   - ❌ `class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-primary..."`

2. **Maintain dark theme consistency** - never use light colors
   - ✅ `bg-card text-card-foreground`
   - ❌ `bg-white text-black`

3. **Use semantic color variables** - never hardcode colors
   - ✅ `bg-primary text-primary-foreground`
   - ❌ `bg-[#7e6fff] text-white`

4. **Follow spacing scale** - use gap-2/4/6, not arbitrary values
   - ✅ `gap-4 p-6`
   - ❌ `gap-[13px] p-[22px]`

5. **Prefer flexbox/grid** over float or absolute positioning
   - ✅ `flex items-center justify-between`
   - ❌ `float-right`

6. **Use transitions** for state changes
   - ✅ `transition-colors hover:bg-accent`
   - ❌ Just `hover:bg-accent` with no transition

