## C# & Blazor Guidelines

### Naming Conventions

**Interfaces:** PascalCase with `I` prefix
```csharp
IPlugin, IPluginManager, IPluginDiscovery
```

**Classes:** PascalCase
```csharp
PluginManager, HelloWorldPlugin, PluginService
```

**Private fields:** camelCase with `_` prefix
```csharp
private readonly IPluginDiscovery _discovery;
private readonly ConcurrentDictionary<string, LoadedPlugin> _loadedPlugins;
private bool _disposed;
```

**Methods:** PascalCase, async methods end with `Async`
```csharp
Task InitializeAsync(IServiceProvider serviceProvider, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default);
Task<IPlugin?> GetPluginAsync(string pluginId, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default);
```

### Type Usage

**Nullable Reference Types:** MANDATORY (enabled globally)
```csharp
✅ CORRECT
public string? Name { get; set; }
IPlugin? plugin = await GetPluginAsync(id);
event EventHandler<PluginEventArgs>? PluginLoaded;

❌ INCORRECT
public string Name { get; set; }
```

**Prefer `var` for obvious types:**
```csharp
var manager = new PluginManager();
var plugins = new ConcurrentDictionary<string, IPlugin>();
```

**Explicit types for clarity:**
```csharp
IPlugin plugin = factory.CreateInstance();
CancellationToken cancellationToken = default;
```

### Async/Await Patterns

**CRITICAL: ALL methods in execution path MUST be async Task**

```csharp
✅ CORRECT
[Fact]
public async Task LoadPlugin_ShouldSucceed() { }

private async Task SetupTestDataAsync() { }
protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync() { }
private async Task OnClickAsync() { }
```

```csharp
❌ FORBIDDEN - These cause test hangs
[Fact]
public void MyTest() { }                    // Sync test
private void Setup() { }                    // Sync helper
private async void OnStateChanged() { }     // async void
```

**Default CancellationToken pattern:**
```csharp
Task ExecuteAsync(CancellationToken cancellationToken = default);
```

**Await everything, no blocking calls:**
```csharp
✅ CORRECT
await plugin.InitializeAsync(serviceProvider, cancellationToken);

❌ INCORRECT
plugin.InitializeAsync(serviceProvider, cancellationToken).Wait();
plugin.InitializeAsync(serviceProvider, cancellationToken).GetAwaiter().GetResult();
```

### Blazor Component Patterns

**Component structure:**
```razor
@page "/example"
@inject IPluginManager PluginManager

<div class="space-y-6">
    <!-- Markup -->
</div>

@code {
    private List<IPlugin>? _plugins;
    private bool _loading = true;
    
    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        await LoadPluginsAsync();
    }
    
    private async Task LoadPluginsAsync()
    {
        _loading = true;
        try
        {
            _plugins = await PluginManager.GetAllPluginsAsync();
        }
        finally
        {
            _loading = false;
        }
    }
}
```

**Event handlers:**
```razor
<!-- Always async -->
<button class="btn btn-default" @onclick="HandleClickAsync">Click</button>

@code {
    private async Task HandleClickAsync()
    {
        await DoSomethingAsync();
        StateHasChanged();
    }
}
```

### Dependency Injection

**Constructor injection (preferred):**
```csharp
public class PluginManager : IPluginManager
{
    private readonly IPluginDiscovery _discovery;
    private readonly IServiceProvider _serviceProvider;

    public PluginManager(IServiceProvider? serviceProvider = null)
    {
        _serviceProvider = serviceProvider ?? new DefaultServiceProvider();
        _discovery = new PluginDiscovery();
    }
}
```

**Service registration:**
```csharp
builder.Services.AddSingleton<IPluginManager, PluginManager>();
builder.Services.AddScoped<PluginService>();
```

