## Build & Commands

### Building
```bash
dotnet build                              # Build entire solution
dotnet build -c Release                   # Release build
```

### Running
```bash
cd src/Pluggable.Shell
dotnet run --urls http://localhost:5000
```

### Testing

**All tests:**
```bash
dotnet test
```

**Filter by spec/story/scenario/UAC:**
```bash
dotnet test --filter "SPEC=0623"
dotnet test --filter "SPEC=0623&US=01"
dotnet test --filter "SPEC=0623&US=01&SC=01"
dotnet test --filter "SPEC=0623&US=01&SC=01&UAC=01"
```

**Single test by name:**
```bash
dotnet test --filter "FullyQualifiedName=Namespace.ClassName.TestMethodName"
```

**bUnit tests only:**
```bash
dotnet test test/Pluggable.Shell.Tests
```

**E2E tests only:**
```bash
dotnet test test/Pluggable.E2E.Tests
```

**Exclude E2E tests:**
```bash
dotnet test --filter "FullyQualifiedName!~E2E"
```

### Tailwind CSS

**Build CSS (automatic via MSBuild):**
```bash
cd src/Pluggable.Shell/wwwroot
npm run build:css
```

**Watch mode (development):**
```bash
cd src/Pluggable.Shell/wwwroot
npm run watch:css
```

